	</row>
	<row id="msg_0138_D49R0101_00048" index="48">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Wassup. Oh, you must be new here.\nWelcome to the Athlete Shop!\rYou and your homies been\nworkin’ out?\rFlyin’ sweat!\nBreathin’ in sync!\fFresh friendship!\rWe support the Pokéathlete lifestyle.\nThe Athlete Points you earned\fcan get spent here on prizes.\rLemme say it again.\nWelcome to the Athlete Shop! {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0138_D49R0101_00049" index="49">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Welcome to the Athlete Shop! {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0138_D49R0101_00050" index="50">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">We closed for the day.\nCome back tomorrow for\fa whole new batch of prizes!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0138_D49R0101_00051" index="51">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Good looks, come back soon.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0138_D49R0101_00052" index="52">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Your scores in the Pokéathlon...\nThe proof of your bond with your\fhomies, so to speak, get you\fAthlete Points.\rYou can trade ’em here for\nall kinds of prizes.\rScore as much as you can and come back\nhere for prizes!\rAnything else I can do\nfor you? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0138_D49R0101_00053" index="53">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Welcome!\rThis where we keep the Pokéathlon\ndatabase.\rUse a Data Card at the monitor\nnext to me to check your\frecords.\rSome is impressive, and some is...\nembarrassin’!\rPut it to good use.\rYou wanna buy a Data Card\nwith Pokéathlon\frecords on it? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0138_D49R0101_00054" index="54">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Welcome!\rWe sell Data Cards with\nPokéathlon records on ’em here.\rYou wanna buy a Data Card? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0138_D49R0101_00055" index="55">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Giggle!\nTruth is, I know a LOT about you!\fLemme see...\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0138_D49R0101_00056" index="56">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You done entered\nthe Pokéathlon...\f{STRVAR_1 51, 0, 0} times!\fGiggle!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0138_D49R0101_00057" index="57">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You done entered\nthe Pokéathlon...\fSheesh, over 100 times!\rBravo!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0138_D49R0101_00058" index="58">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Like I just showed, the Pokéathlon\ndatabase know EVERYTHING.\fAin’t that interestin’?\rYou can trade your Athlete Points\nfor a Data Card and check your\frecords on the monitor next to me.\rPut it to good use.\nAnything else I can\fdo for you? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0138_D49R0101_00059" index="59">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Good looks. Come back soon!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0138_D49R0101_00060" index="60">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Wassup, Pokéathlete {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\rYou workin’ on breakin’ your own\nrecords? You can check your records\fon the monitor next to me.\rPeep it every now and then!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0138_D49R0101_00061" index="61">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">We outta Data Cards.\nBut don’t be sad.\rMore Data Cards comin’!\nI’ll make sure to get ’em for you.\fCome back later.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0138_D49R0101_00062" index="62">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">We outta Data Cards.\nBut don’t be sad.\rMore Data Cards comin’...\nOr not!\rYou collected ALL the Data Cards!\nWonderful!\rYou a true Pokéathlete,\n{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\rKeep workin’ on breakin’\nyour own records!\rGood looks for comin’!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0138_D49R0101_00063" index="63">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">So they got ten events?\n...Which homie I’mma pick?</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0138_D49R0101_00064" index="64">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">There’s five Pokéathlon courses!\rThey split into Speed, Power,\nStamina, Jump, and Skill.\rYou gotta pick your homies\ncarefully for the course.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0138_D49R0101_00065" index="65">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Some homies good at Speed events.\nSome ain’t. You gotta build a team\fthat can help each other out.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0138_D49R0101_00066" index="66">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">If you keep goin’, you’ll see the\nMuseum of Pokéathlete Records.\rOne day I’mma be a Pokéathlete with\na record in there!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0138_D49R0101_00067" index="67">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Your score in the Pokéathlon\nturn into Athlete Points, and you can\ftrade ’em for prizes.\rEven if you finish dead last,\nyour score still count!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0138_D49R0101_00068" index="68">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">“Hurdle Dash”\rMad Hurdles waitin’ on your homies!\nBe faster and sharper than\feverybody else! Jump the Hurdles\fand go for number one!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0138_D49R0101_00069" index="69">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">“Pennant Capture”\rPennants is hidden on the beach.\nFight over ’em and come back with as\fmany Pennants as you can!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0138_D49R0101_00070" index="70">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">“Circle Push”\rTime to show off your\nhomie’s Power!\fPush ’em out and stay in the Circle!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0138_D49R0101_00071" index="71">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">“Block Smash”\rA mountain of Blocks waitin’ on\nyour homies!\fUse that Power to smash ’em all!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0138_D49R0101_00072" index="72">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">“Disc Catch”\rDiscs get thrown at you. Jump and\ncatch ’em in the air!\rDon’t get boxed in by the others.\nCatch as many as you can!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0138_D49R0101_00073" index="73">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">“Lamp Jump”\rYou never know how high you gon’\nbounce! Use your homie’s Jump\fand Skill to score!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0138_D49R0101_00074" index="74">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">“Relay Run”\rKeep runnin’ till you can’t run\nno more! Three homies work together\fto get the W!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0138_D49R0101_00075" index="75">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">“Ring Drop”\rHomies tackle! Push past your Stamina\nlimit and stay in the Ring!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0138_D49R0101_00076" index="76">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">“Snow Throw”\rOn a field that’s colder than cold,\nMILLIONS of Snowballs waitin’!\rAim and throw!\nTime it right to show your skill!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0138_D49R0101_00077" index="77">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">“Goal Roll”\rPut your whole heart into hittin’ the\nball! Attack! Defend your Goal!\rAim for the other Goals!\nWho gon’ get the W?</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0138_D49R0101_00078" index="78">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Work with your homies. Believe in ’em,\nand help ’em believe in you!\fBelieve in their potential.\fLet the friendship lead\nyour team to the W!\rThe Pokéathlon always with you!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0138_D49R0101_00079" index="79">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Charge up with friendship!\nGive Aprijuice to your homies!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0138_D49R0101_00080" index="80">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Whitney: Ayo, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}! You here\nfor the Pokéathlon? Me too!\rI been SO hype since they\nbuilt it. It’s right by Goldenrod\fCity, you know?\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0138_D49R0101_00081" index="81">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Huh?\rYou was finna enter\nthe Pokéathlon lookin’ like THAT?\rYou ain’t prepared at all, huh?\rSo...\nYou a medium or a small?\fYou look more like a medium...\rOK!\nI’mma get you a jersey that fit!\rYou gotta look your best if you\nenterin’ the Pokéathlon,\fright?\rWait right there!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0138_D49R0101_00082" index="82">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">This fit you perfect!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0138_D49R0101_00083" index="83">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} got a jersey!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0138_D49R0101_00084" index="84">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You look perfect.\nNow that you ready, I’mma...\rOh, no!\nWhere my homies at?\rI gotta go back.\nSee ya!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0138_D49R0101_00085" index="85">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The vendin’ machine is for\nparticipants! You can even use\fAthlete Points. {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0138_D49R0101_00086" index="86">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Which drink you want? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0138_D49R0101_00087" index="87">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Clang!\rA can of {STRVAR_1 8, 0, 0} dropped down.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0138_D49R0101_00088" index="88">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Clang!\rBonus! Another can of {STRVAR_1 8, 0, 0}\ndropped down.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0138_D49R0101_00089" index="89">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Not enough bread...</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0138_D49R0101_00090" index="90">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Not enough points...</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0138_D49R0101_00091" index="91">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Decided not to buy a drink.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0138_D49R0101_00092" index="92">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Openin’ the Pokéathlon Data...\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0138_D49R0101_00093" index="93">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Which data you wanna see? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0138_D49R0101_00094" index="94">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">OVERALL DATA {ALN_CENTER}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0138_D49R0101_00095" index="95">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">EVENT DATA {ALN_CENTER}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0138_D49R0101_00096" index="96">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">ACTION DATA {ALN_CENTER}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0138_D49R0101_00097" index="97">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">EXIT {ALN_CENTER}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0138_D49R0101_00098" index="98">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Accessin’......</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0138_D49R0101_00099" index="99">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Accessin’............</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0138_D49R0101_00100" index="100">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Accessin’..................</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0138_D49R0101_00101" index="101">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Good looks for accessin’!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0138_D49R0101_00102" index="102">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Welcome to the Museum Shop!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0138_D49R0101_00103" index="103">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Sheesh, you got good eyes! Can\nI tell you about my last dream? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0138_D49R0101_00104" index="104">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Hmmm... My sharp eyes musta\ngot weak...</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0138_D49R0101_00105" index="105">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I used to love Jump events.\rMy record from back when I was\nactive as a Pokéathlete is 998 jumps!\rJust two more!\nAll I needed was TWO more!\rI had to retire ’cause of my age...\nCould you jump 1,000 times\ffor me?\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0138_D49R0101_00106" index="106">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Well, the record might make you dizzy.\nBut you still young.\fYou can do it!\rI’ll just sit here and wait.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0138_D49R0101_00107" index="107">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Oh! You!\nThat’s so wonderful of you!\fYou jumped 1,000 times.\rGood looks, fr!\nHere’s a lil somethin’ to say thanks.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0138_D49R0101_00108" index="108">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I’m your fan now. I’m old as you see,\nbut I got your back no matter what.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0138_D49R0101_00109" index="109">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You know what?\nI FINALLY tackled over 500 times!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0138_D49R0101_00110" index="110">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Haha!\nYou doin’ fine, but not as good\fas me. I wonder if any Pokéathlete\fcould tackle better than me.\fSigh...</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0138_D49R0101_00111" index="111">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You know what?\nI tackled over 1,000 times!\fFinally!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0138_D49R0101_00112" index="112">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You know what? I FINALLY tackled\nover 2,000 times! Bet nobody\fbreakin’ that record easy!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0138_D49R0101_00113" index="113">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">......!\nNo! That ain’t right!\fYour record beat mine?\rNooooo!\n...Aight. You win.\rI admit total defeat.\nTake this.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0138_D49R0101_00114" index="114">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Whew!\nIt’s weird, but I feel great.\rI’m salty I lost, but it showed\nme where I’m at.\rI know there’s a lotta\nPokéathletes better than me.\rThis where I start growin’ again!\nKeep it up!</language>
	</row>
</body>
